# Local-only secret for the telemetry Worker (optional).
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in a fine-grained, PUBLIC-read-only GitHub PAT.
# Without it the Worker calls the GitHub API unauthenticated (60 req/hr, fine behind the 5-min cache).
# In production, set this as a Cloudflare Worker secret instead (dashboard → Settings → Variables/Secrets).
GITHUB_TOKEN=
